desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic"
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	type: vuln
	level: critical
	rule_id: "source-config-claude-settings-env-url-override-generic"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
API base URL override detected in settings or environment file. ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL or OPENAI_BASE_URL overrides can redirect all API traffic to an attacker-controlled server, exposing prompts, code, and API keys. Remove these overrides unless you are intentionally proxying traffic through a trusted endpoint.

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-923: Improper Restriction of Communication Channel to Intended Endpoints
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则收紧配置，显式启用安全选项，并定期审计配置项。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos/settings.json": <<<POS
OPENAI_BASE_URL	  
 	 	 	
:		 

"
	
	

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p0
${/.*\/\.env[^\/]*/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p1
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p2
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/(ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL|OPENAI_BASE_URL)\s*"?\s*[=:]\s*"?\s*\S+/) as $p3
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
	message: "Claude Settings Env URL Override Generic",
}
